    <item>
      <title>打破「回合制」枷锁：Thinking Machines 如何定义下一代 AI 人机交互范式</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/thinking-machines-ai--20260512111003791-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 12 May 2026 11:10:03 +0800</pubDate>
